k the centre","Open the centre fold","Lower the right ear","Lower the left ear","Fold up the muzzle"],"descriptions":["Bring the top corner to the bottom corner and align the edges.","Bring the right corner to the left. Press the centre crease lightly.","Open that fold. Keep the first diagonal folded; the centre mark helps place the ears.","Fold both layers of the right corner down. The angled crease makes a hanging ear.","Make a matching fold on the left. Compare the two ear tips before pressing.","Turn both layers of the bottom tip upward. The folded face is complete; add eyes and a nose to your real paper if you like."]}